              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This dataset contains the results of a survey among researchers at the UMCU into the barriers they experience when sharing data and software themselves, and reusing data that is published in data repositories.</p>\n<p>This dataset contains two pseudonymized data files</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://dataverse.nl/file.xhtml?fileId=194333\">processed_data_UMCU.csv</a>\n     (codebook for this file is <a href=\"https://dataverse.nl/file.xhtml?fileId=194332\">codebook.csv</a>)\n<li><a href=\"https://dataverse.nl/file.xhtml?fileId=194336\">interview_notes.txt</a>\n</ul>\n<p>plus notebooks in R and Python with step-by-step analyses:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://dataverse.nl/file.xhtml?fileId=194335\">analysis_on_UMCU_data.Rmd</a>\n    (HTML version <a href=\"https://dataverse.nl/file.xhtml?fileId=194340\">analysis_on_UMCU_data_notebook.html</a>)\n<li><a href=\"https://dataverse.nl/file.xhtml?fileId=194334\">topic_modelling_content_analysis_notebook.ipynb</a>\n    (HTML version <a href=\"https://dataverse.nl/file.xhtml?fileId=194339\">topic_modelling_content_analysis_notebook.html</a>)\n</ul>\n<p>and a complete description of the methods, results and conclusions:\n<a href=\"https://dataverse.nl/file.xhtml?fileId=195461\">\t\nNeeds_Assessment_FAIR_and_Open_Science.pdf</a></p>"
                }
              }
